        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "After eight years, CUNY ASAP’s average cost per associate degree was $9,162 higher than control ($84,087 versus $74,925 in 2019 dollars).",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "This is MDRC’s CUNY educational-cost comparison per associate degree, over eight years. The report says ASAP was no longer cost-effective on this measure; it is not a benefit-cost ratio.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
